# Homework Guide 📚

A simple Python app to help students organize their schoolwork, track deadlines, and manage different types of assessments (tests, exams, projects, assignments).

## ✨ Features
- Add tasks with subject, description, deadline, and assessment type
- View all tasks in a clean list
- Delete tasks you no longer need
- Interactive menu system

## 🚀 Future Improvements
- Save tasks permanently in a file
- Add quiz practice (Maths, English vocab, etc.)
- Motivational quote generator

